# 23. Frontend Principles

* Keep business logic in the backend.
* Use reusable and composable components.
* Maintain a consistent design system.
* Provide clear feedback for every user action.
* Make AI decisions transparent through workflow and audit views.
* Ensure every major action is traceable and easy to understand.

This architecture supports the backend design while delivering a scalable, maintainable, and enterprise-grade user experience aligned with the hackathon's evaluation criteria.
